# JOURNEY · the first step of every circuit: get a botfish and confirm it can be wired.
# A Legendary is caught on its banner, never bought (economy epic, 2026-09-24): the shop's fish page
# sells no Botfish, Cashfish or Mutantfish, and the catch a journey cannot fish on cue is handed over
# by the scene, named, the way a catch card names it.

clear
include scenes/start-with-a-stake.play
run /shop
key enter
select Fishes
key enter
expect Price/unit
absent Botfish
absent Cashfish
absent Mutantfish
snap the fish catalogue sells no Legendary
key esc
key esc
key esc
absent Price/unit

include scenes/take-a-fish.play botfish neo
expect 40.0k
snap the purse paid nothing for a fish nobody sells

run /index
expect Neo
snap Neo joined the tank
key esc

run /program "Neo"
expect listens
expect trigger
snap a taken botfish is wired like any other
key esc
